      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This is a fantastic 3-bedroom semidetached residence with large detached garage to the rear. Located to the front of this mature estate, within walking distance of all the amenities that Mullingar town has to offer.\r\n\r\nThe property is brought to the market in excellent condition having recently been redecorated throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly consists of entrance Hall, sitting room with double doors to the kitchen/dining room, 3 bedrooms, bathroom with the primary bedroom having an ensuite.\r\n\r\nThe grounds are easily maintained, with off street parking. The detached garage is ideal for a work from home station or a hobby space"
      },
